==Battleground==
*5 [[Croco]]s (400%) spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s (400%) spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s (400%) spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s (400%) spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**7 [[Croco]]s (100%) spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A somewhat hard stage not many units can beat. Bring any of the Normal Cats to win.

While [[THE SLOTH]] may seem powerful to those who haven't encountered it yet, you can easily kill him using most cats that can tank a hit from him. Bahamut Cat is also advisable to use, but only if at a level around 20-40. If you have any of the Crazed Cats (e.g. Crazed Giraffe Cat or Crazed Titan Cat), use them to either rush the stage or brute-force the main threat.

